{"title":"Willow Burl","slug":"Willow_Burl","hero":{"file":"1029209410_9938675423_1764291955142.webp","width":400,"height":225},"pageid":4411,"revid":20579,"timestamp":"2025-11-28T06:04:42Z","lastEditor":"Drittenfire","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Burl","fields":[{"label":"$/burl","value":"WIP"},{"label":"$/sanded","value":"WIP"}]},"sections":[],"body":"<p><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Burls/\">Burls</a> are a sub-resource of trees. <b>Willow Burls</b> spawn extremely rarely on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Willow/\">Willow Trees</a> in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flowering_Meadows/\">Flowering Meadows</a> and the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Acidlands/\">Acidlands</a>.\n</p>\n\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Four willow burls found still attached to a willow tree in the Acidlands.\">Four willow burls found still attached to a willow tree in the Acidlands.</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/1029209410_9938675423_1764291955142.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Four willow burls found still attached to a willow tree in the Acidlands.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>"}
